# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# AUTO JOB APPLIER — Environment Configuration
# cp .env.example .env  then edit the values you need
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ─── AI Mode ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
#   auto   → try Gemini, fallback OpenAI, fallback local  (DEFAULT)
#   local  → built-in keyword matcher, NO API calls at all
#   gemini → Gemini only (requires GEMINI_API_KEY)
#   openai → OpenAI only (requires OPENAI_API_KEY)
#
AI_MODE=auto

# ─── AI API Keys (leave blank to run in local/offline mode) ──────────────────
GEMINI_API_KEY=
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# ─── Database Selection (priority: MongoDB > Supabase > SQLite) ────────────────
#
#   MongoDB (recommended for VPS):
#     MONGODB_URL=mongodb://user:password@host:27017/auto-job-applier
#   OR with Atlas:
#     MONGODB_URL=mongodb+srv://user:password@cluster.mongodb.net/auto-job-applier
#
#   Supabase (cloud):
#     SUPABASE_URL=sb_publishable_...
#     SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY=...
#
#   SQLite (local, no config needed)

MONGODB_URL=

SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY=

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# ─── Backend ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
PORT=4000
NODE_ENV=production
LOG_LEVEL=info
FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:3000
DATA_DIR=/app/data

# ─── Frontend ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# URL the browser uses to reach the backend API.
# Docker local: keep http://localhost:4000
# Remote server: set to https://your-domain.com:4000
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4000

# ─── Job discovery: ATS boards ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Which company job boards to pull postings from, comma separated as
# <ats>:<board-token>. Supported: greenhouse, lever, ashby.
#
# The token is the company's board slug, visible in its careers URL:
#   https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/anthropic  → greenhouse:anthropic
#   https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/ramp               → ashby:ramp
#   https://jobs.lever.co/matchgroup            → lever:matchgroup
#
# Leave unset to use the built-in sample list (placeholders — replace them).
ATS_BOARDS=

# ─── Application submission ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Fill every form and screenshot it, but never click submit. Use this to
# confirm the driver behaves before letting it apply for real.
ATS_DRY_RUN=0

# ─── Scheduler ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Unattended runs. Disabled unless AUTO_RUN_INTERVAL_HOURS is a positive
# number. The per-day cap and the automationMode switch still apply.
AUTO_RUN_INTERVAL_HOURS=
# Skip runs inside this local-time window; may wrap midnight, e.g. 22-7
AUTO_RUN_QUIET_HOURS=
# Set to 1 to also run once, 30s after the backend starts
AUTO_RUN_ON_START=0

# ─── Deployment ports ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# On a host already running other services, bind to loopback and let your
# reverse proxy or tunnel reach these.
BIND_ADDR=0.0.0.0
BACKEND_PORT=4000
FRONTEND_PORT=3000

# ─── Outbound HTTP pacing ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Job boards throttle hard above single-user volume. These bound how fast we
# talk to them; raise only if you know a board tolerates it.
# Requests in flight across all hosts.
HTTP_CONCURRENCY=3
# Minimum gap between two requests to the same host, in milliseconds.
HTTP_MIN_HOST_GAP_MS=700
